 R←Test_Compose_07(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;parms;rc;msg;text;tempFile
⍝ An attachment whose file has gone before the email is composed is reported as an error
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 tempFile←(FilesAndDirs.GetTempPath),'SMTP-Test-',(⍕⎕TS[7]),'.txt'
 (⊂'Some text')⎕NPUT tempFile
 parms←∆NewMail'Attachment test'
 parms.From←'tester@aplteam.test'
 parms.AddAttachment tempFile
 ⎕NDELETE tempFile
 (rc msg text)←∆Compose parms
 →T.PassesIf ¯1=rc
 →T.PassesIf'Error processing attachment 1: cannot read file "'≡49↑msg
 →T.PassesIf∨/tempFile⍷msg

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
